    "name": "Roll Roll Hero",
    "steam_appid": 3480590,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Spice Guild is Hiring Brave New Guardians\u2026 Grab Your Backpack, Roll Roll Heroes, Stop Slacking! It\u2019s Time to Set Off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/9bac4e17d35224bc4cb70b3f835bb104.avif?t=1739773566\" width=640 height=260 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Art of Combo Crafting</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, you can choose a new item to toss into your backpack and hurl it onto the battlefield to attack enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/b4e9a2bc5f3beea30e3b2ac6e1d8a7c7.poster.avif?t=1739773566\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/b4e9a2bc5f3beea30e3b2ac6e1d8a7c7.webm?t=1739773566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/b4e9a2bc5f3beea30e3b2ac6e1d8a7c7.mp4?t=1739773566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item has its own execution rules and interacts with nearby items to trigger devastating combos. Experiment with different playstyles to adapt to your foes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/c4e37e54af6f94200428e7111b537bd5.poster.avif?t=1739773566\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/c4e37e54af6f94200428e7111b537bd5.webm?t=1739773566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/c4e37e54af6f94200428e7111b537bd5.mp4?t=1739773566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero comes equipped with unique skills to help you conquer the dungeon's trials.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chart Your Path, Forge Your Destiny</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your adventure route freely\u2014rest by a campfire, shop for supplies, or face random events that might dramatically change your journey ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're lucky, you might stumble upon powerful relics along the way!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clever Enemies Await Your Challenge</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From hypnotic spellcasters and explosive foes to those that hijack your backpack items, each dungeon's enemies bring their own unique mechanics. Plan your strategies wisely to overcome them!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/60d3a89fa9498f0caed71e863c373825.poster.avif?t=1739773566\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/60d3a89fa9498f0caed71e863c373825.webm?t=1739773566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/60d3a89fa9498f0caed71e863c373825.mp4?t=1739773566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/86757117e8867af6c2f4ff2cf33450a8.poster.avif?t=1739773566\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/86757117e8867af6c2f4ff2cf33450a8.webm?t=1739773566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/86757117e8867af6c2f4ff2cf33450a8.mp4?t=1739773566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/b05e070a67e1bf39ab06b885645401d9.poster.avif?t=1739773566\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/b05e070a67e1bf39ab06b885645401d9.webm?t=1739773566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/b05e070a67e1bf39ab06b885645401d9.mp4?t=1739773566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With <strong>150+ trinkets</strong>, <strong>50+ relics</strong>, <strong>80+ pieces of gear</strong>, and <strong>4+ unique heroes</strong>, your adventure will always feel fresh. Gear up, experiment, and emerge victorious!</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Spice Guild is Hiring Brave New Guardians\u2026 Grab Your Backpack, Roll Roll Heroes, Stop Slacking! It\u2019s Time to Set Off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/9bac4e17d35224bc4cb70b3f835bb104.avif?t=1739773566\" width=640 height=260 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Art of Combo Crafting</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, you can choose a new item to toss into your backpack and hurl it onto the battlefield to attack enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/b4e9a2bc5f3beea30e3b2ac6e1d8a7c7.poster.avif?t=1739773566\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/b4e9a2bc5f3beea30e3b2ac6e1d8a7c7.webm?t=1739773566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/b4e9a2bc5f3beea30e3b2ac6e1d8a7c7.mp4?t=1739773566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item has its own execution rules and interacts with nearby items to trigger devastating combos. Experiment with different playstyles to adapt to your foes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/c4e37e54af6f94200428e7111b537bd5.poster.avif?t=1739773566\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/c4e37e54af6f94200428e7111b537bd5.webm?t=1739773566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/c4e37e54af6f94200428e7111b537bd5.mp4?t=1739773566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero comes equipped with unique skills to help you conquer the dungeon's trials.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chart Your Path, Forge Your Destiny</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your adventure route freely\u2014rest by a campfire, shop for supplies, or face random events that might dramatically change your journey ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're lucky, you might stumble upon powerful relics along the way!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clever Enemies Await Your Challenge</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From hypnotic spellcasters and explosive foes to those that hijack your backpack items, each dungeon's enemies bring their own unique mechanics. Plan your strategies wisely to overcome them!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/60d3a89fa9498f0caed71e863c373825.poster.avif?t=1739773566\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/60d3a89fa9498f0caed71e863c373825.webm?t=1739773566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/60d3a89fa9498f0caed71e863c373825.mp4?t=1739773566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/86757117e8867af6c2f4ff2cf33450a8.poster.avif?t=1739773566\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/86757117e8867af6c2f4ff2cf33450a8.webm?t=1739773566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/86757117e8867af6c2f4ff2cf33450a8.mp4?t=1739773566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/b05e070a67e1bf39ab06b885645401d9.poster.avif?t=1739773566\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/b05e070a67e1bf39ab06b885645401d9.webm?t=1739773566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/b05e070a67e1bf39ab06b885645401d9.mp4?t=1739773566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With <strong>150+ trinkets</strong>, <strong>50+ relics</strong>, <strong>80+ pieces of gear</strong>, and <strong>4+ unique heroes</strong>, your adventure will always feel fresh. Gear up, experiment, and emerge victorious!</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Roll Roll Hero is a rogue-like deck-builder where you gather items while crawling through dungeons. Mix and match them to unleash powerful combos and defeat foes! Recruit adventurers with unique skills to alter the dungeon's &quot;feng shui.&quot; Stockpile your loot, but watch out for chaos!",
